 "headline": "Hunter Carries MONSTARS While Thug Life Watches",
 "notes": [
  "Shai Gilgeous-Alexander dropped 38 points, four threes and seven assists on Adam Silver Dez Nuts' bench, a lineup crime in the middle of a 7-2 lead.",
  "Jaden McDaniels hung 34 points, 10 boards, 6 assists and 4 threes for Thug Life, and Thug Life is still losing 7-4.",
  "Nova Knicks got nothing from Ryan Kalkbrenner, whose stat line is blank, and lost the 5-4 lead to LeParth James that existed an update ago.",
  "Scottie Barnes and Tyler Herro combined for 63 points, which is how MONSTARS \u2604\ufe0f are 7-4 and ranked first on the night.",
  "LeParth James ranks dead last on the night, with Svi Mykhailiuk at 1-7 and Anfernee Simons at 1-3, and still leads Nova Knicks 6-4."
 ],
